I still circulate the complete gismu list, and I've written some non-PC 
works in lojban, too. (For example, I wouldn't call my translation of 
Karin Dreijer's political, satirical song lyric _The Cop_ particularly 
PC) I just like that lojban makes it so easy to be PC compared to the 
latin languages, and I wanted to express my admiration for that (and my 
preference for non-gender-specific language (prenu instead of ninmu, etc)).

